        <hr class="divider" />
        <div class="text-center mb-4">
          <a href="<%= locals.submitFormUrl || '#' %>" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary btn-dark btn-xl me-3 py-3 px-4 me-lg-3 mb-4 mb-lg-0">Submission Form (Password Required)</a>
          <a href="<%= basePath %>/#contact" id="request-access-btn" data-subject="<%= locals.siteName || '#' %> Access Request" data-message="Hi! I’d like to request access to the <%= locals.siteName || '#' %> measure upload form." class="btn btn-primary btn-dark btn-xl py-3 px-4 me-lg-3 mb-4 mb-lg-0">Request Access</a>
        </div>
        <p class="text-muted text-center mb-5">If you have a validated self-report measure pertaining to interpersonal relationships, we invite you to add it to the repository by completing a short form.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="container px-4 px-lg-5" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
		
        <div class="row align-items-center">
